   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "d2d1 = calc_bmsm_flux_errors(bmsm_fluxes_d2d1)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "75cf7aa8",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Now propagate error to get $K_{ex}=\\frac{k_{12}}{k_{21}}$"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 629,
   "id": "6f5d1df1",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "Kex = d1d2[\"mean rate\"] / d2d1[\"mean rate\"]"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "dbea0214",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Error propagation from division of rates:\n",
    "\n",
    "Given $z = \\frac{x}{y}$ :\n",
    "\n",
    "$\\frac{\\Delta{Z}}{Z} = \\sqrt{(\\frac{\\Delta{x}}{x})^2 + (\\frac{\\Delta{y}}{y})^2 + ...}$\n",
    "\n",
    "Solving for $\\Delta{Z}$:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 630,
   "id": "2a13d06d",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "K_error = Kex * np.sqrt((d1d2[\"std rate\"] / d1d2[\"mean rate\"])**2 + (d2d1[\"std rate\"] / d2d1[\"mean rate\"])**2)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 631,
   "id": "17b1a489",
   "metadata": {
    "scrolled": true
   },
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "k_12 = 0.004 ± 0.00012\n",
      "k_21 = 0.012 ± 0.00048\n",
      "K_ex = 0.346 ± 0.01712\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "print(f\"k_12 = {d1d2['mean rate']:0.3f} ± {d1d2['std rate']:0.5f}\")\n",
    "print(f\"k_21 = {d2d1['mean rate']:0.3f} ± {d2d1['std rate']:0.5f}\")\n",
    "print(f\"K_ex = {Kex:0.3f} ± {K_error:0.5f}\")"
   ]
  },
